4:00] Diana**: Preview overlay is accepted — we're good to close this.\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 14:26] Alice**: Good, this gives reviewers real confidence the system's doing the right thing.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 25 slack thread redact preview highlight channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 06 last activ 2026 08 08 2026 08 06 08 40 charli implement the highlight logic for the preview overlay pull the region coordin straight from the yaml redact polici config so it stay in sync with whatev region are defin there 2026 08 06 08 42 charli highlight engin is in it map each yaml configur region to a bound box on the overlay shell 2026 08 06 08 43 diana check it now look solid so far 2026 08 06 08 44 diana one issu highlight are slight offset on rotat page 2026 08 06 08 46 charli fix wasn t account for the page rotat properti in the coordin transform 2026 08 08 12 58 diana verifi rotat page are highlight correct now overlay and highlight togeth meet the visual review requir 2026 08 08 14 00 diana preview overlay is accept we re good to close this 2026 08 08 14 26 alic good this give review real confid the system s do the right thing\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee223e6c8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-redaction-preview-highlighting.md\", \"id\": \"9441a46edb882406\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33950949212664405, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16701060303806295, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7420069, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-redaction-preview-highlighting.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee223e6c8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-redaction-preview-highlighting.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-06-redaction-preview-highlighting.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1174, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:07:47\", \"token_count\": 333, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-05\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Offset Mismatch Debugging\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-06-23\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 08:56] Charlie**: @Diana, I'm seeing weird behavior in the test cases. The redaction masks are shifted by a character or two in some PDF exports.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 09:01] Diana**: Multi-column layouts? I told you pdfminer output was injecting spaces.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 09:43] Charlie**: It's not just the spaces. The engine sees the text at one offset, but the PDF coordinates are different after the cleaning phase.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:51] Diana**: Are you seeing this on all viewers? Sometimes Acrobat renders overlays differently than Chrome's PDF viewer.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:52] Charlie**: Looking at the raw coordinate output for now. Whitespace normalization looks like the culprit — non-breaking spaces keep showing up in the extracted text.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:53] Charlie**: Still stuck. Tried mapping cleaned offsets back to raw ones, but the math falls apart on dense pages.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:40] Diana**: Can we get most of the standard text aligned and park the edge cases?\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:42] Charlie**: Not really — on dense docs it's closer to half the spans. Starting to look like an upstream pdfminer.six issue. I'm going to check their tracker.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:45] Alice**: Status?\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:47] Charlie**: No. Offline tonight.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 05 slack thread offset mismatch debug channel cipherdoc date 2026 06 23 2026 06 23 08 56 charli diana i m see weird behavior in 