ty\": 0.3200760952289078, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1176163103270111, \"vector_similarity\": 0.79248226, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee5a9c8a8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-41-Large-File-Chunking.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1122, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:55\", \"token_count\": 577, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAudit third-party licenses across the dependency tree before release. An initial audit led to swapping the PDF parser library, but the task was reopened when the replacement parser turned out to be AGPL-licensed; the team is now searching for an Apache/MIT-licensed alternative.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Full dependency tree is audited for license compliance.\\n\\n- No restrictive copyleft (e.g., AGPL) licenses remain in the shipped dependency set.\\n\\n- Apache/MIT-licensed PDF parser alternative is identified and adopted, resolving the reopened AGPL finding.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n